{"id":10000077,"name":"瑶瑶","enName":"Yaoyao","title":"仙蕊玲珑","element":"草","region":"璃月","rarity":4,"weapon":"长柄武器","birthday":"3月6日","constellation":"木樨座","description":"歌尘浪市真君膝下最年幼的弟子，温柔体贴的「小大人」。","affiliation":"歌尘浪市真君洞天","cv":{"chinese":"刘颐诺","japanese":"门胁舞以","english":"凯尔西·加法尔","korean":"柳惠知"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000077-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000077-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Yaoyao.zip","voicePackageEn":"Yaoyao","quoteCount":70,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"初次见面，我是瑶瑶，忝列门墙，师从歌尘浪市真君。出门在外，若有不便…请叫上我！瑶瑶有礼了。对了，我这里有炸萝卜丸子，吃一点吧！但是不可以多吃哦，油腻的东西吃多了对身体的负担会增加的。如果没吃饱，我还带了洗干净的萝卜和醋，可以给你凉拌萝卜丝吃。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/hksg1aymipn22wiw4u3rndp30e0qfx9.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·大道理","desc":"「明日复明日，明日何其多…」总之，快快行动起来吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a0/gbc1gdkyyhcga5yzf7kkptu8g2xc0cg.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·凑热闹","desc":"那边好像有什么动静，偷偷看一眼的话，应该没事吧！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/561aqalml5h8wz1lsjt1qa6d03a0b9h.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·寻仙问道","desc":"真奇怪，为什么总有人想寻仙问道呢？仙人不是到处都是吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/pocuqb1ag3na1sq7szvnl5iaold2vap.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"你听，青蛙的叫声，像不像在给雨声伴奏？呱呱呱。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/qwtdcq3kcmhpum5jpafkfse5cas133t.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"呜、呜哇！我、我帮你捂住耳朵，害怕的话就抓紧我的手。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/oqtp8r6w33n9vl8lo93au16gbskkk4k.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"下——雪——啦——！你先穿上毛茸茸的外套，戴上厚厚的帽子和围巾，喏，别忘了还有手套，我们再去堆雪人吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/npdandcthj3bouw9b2yew7whmtpqh7g.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天气很好呢，我们去璃月港的码头逛逛吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/m2jsr4kb8z01gpco481sxrq5ykni3th.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"小心哦，别被风吹走啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e3/sbhi1agmg7pz781x5a422427aomyynm.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"该起床啦，我已经准备好早饭了，你动作快些…欸、欸？回笼觉吗？那好吧，只能再多睡五分钟哦！五分钟后我再来叫你~哎，早知道就该提醒你早点睡…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/8htm0sqaegb0ypl0f2m6hkq9tukcajl.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"你要记住哦~吃完午饭后，不要立刻躺下午睡，也不能马上动身冒险，这些都对消化不好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/tomkt0105a5ygxlfnnq9i1rpgigijk2.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"欸？晚上还要出门吗？唔…什么时候才能回来呀？天色已晚，小心为上哦~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/qzk36qvtefu4yq6018qkrty8lxj5os1.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"睡前故事…上回和你…说、说到哪里来着…璃月自古时起…便有三眼五显仙人守护，其、其中…呼呼…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/9jq6ap6w0tkk0gsi4m2txa1qc8pmm93.mp3"},{"title":"关于瑶瑶自己·璃月码头","desc":"你知道吗？璃月港的码头，总是人声鼎沸，可热闹了！和我家那种静到叶子掉在地上都能听见的感觉完全不一样呢！所以，我一有空就爱跑去码头看看。新来的船，新鲜的见闻…还有新玩具！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/9mhrcxe2s6ov8p8t1jn5st509m5qfxv.mp3"},{"title":"关于瑶瑶自己·吃饱穿暖","desc":"所谓「仓廪实则知礼节，衣食足则知荣辱」，所以说，出门在外，要好好吃饭，衣裳穿暖…呃、欸？这句话不是这样的意思吗？那是什么意思呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/q5j8pbwrmu3b8o4qyde90osrgazb64y.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·练枪","desc":"不是我偷懒，是枪太长，又很重，练枪真的挺辛苦的…好在师父对我的要求不高，嘿嘿。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/8qvhixtdgau4nc87zlxphr3nq4kpzy2.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·牵肠挂肚","desc":"最近有按时吃饭吗？天冷了，有好好添衣裳吗？冒险的时候有没有遇到危险？有没有受伤？哎呀算了，要不你还是带上我吧，草行露宿，我实在有点放心不下你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/45/tfiacvhrfas4oplm7te0y17aa5likbh.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"师父是三眼五显仙人！但她告诉过我，神之眼代表着神明的认可。可我也没有做什么特别的呀？真想和神明大人聊聊天，听听她的想法呢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/br0k3fenyrq3b9nlk94xd7ge4jk7ng4.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"奥赛尔？说的是海里的那个超级大的云来大章鱼吗？啊！我不是想吃，只是…如果想吃的话一定记得要烤熟了再吃…呀！不一定非要烤，只是…只是我觉得烤着会很好吃…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/72/1sxw3otod39zfvqqw97xcl4qcbcyvw8.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"我喜欢小团雀哦，去找七七玩的时候，经常能在路上见到。我还会和它们打招呼呢！啾啾啾♪～哎呀，被你猜对了，真聪明！确实是早早早的意思哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/0458gnr3mixlo9xgjqocqenbj07qxks.mp3"},{"title":"关于香菱…","desc":"师姐她最近…没有去找什么奇怪的食材吧？上次她说要生吃云来大章鱼，可让我担心坏了，要是吃坏了肚子可怎么办呀？她又不喜欢吃白先生的苦药。我求了师父一起劝住了她，可不要又看上另一种危险的食材了…哎…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_xiangling_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/htt6iua042fl67u7h7jodb9kokfteom.mp3"},{"title":"关于七七·好朋友","desc":"七七是我最好的朋友！她有时候会忘记我，但我知道她不是故意的，只要提醒她看一下笔记，她马上就能想起来。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_qiqi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/qcki41gwf05znsad8ejctfqnm6heljf.mp3"},{"title":"关于七七·一辈子","desc":"其实我也悄悄问过白先生，有没有办法治好她…嗯…没关系的，就算要提醒她一辈子，我也没关系的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_qiqi_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/k8kbfo3nxqa7sr2uo8qx9nkbznpqp58.mp3"},{"title":"关于白术…","desc":"白先生开的方子可有效啦。虽然苦是有点苦，但这就是所谓的「良药苦口」吧！我理解的！哎呀，你怕苦吗？别担心，我这边有蜜枣，喝完药吃一颗就好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_baizhu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/f8ilb549f5dsin8kt1e5y1td9cknk37.mp3"},{"title":"关于甘雨…","desc":"甘雨姐姐的工作一直很多，听说上次她还因为劳累，不小心趴在草地上睡着了，哎，让人担心！要不…我们进行一个「突击检查」！过去看看她有没有好好照顾自己吧？啊…稍等我一下，我去准备些甘雨姐姐喜欢吃的花花草草…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_ganyu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0b/cqm6e573a31iwn76cqsql49ybxopcq7.mp3"},{"title":"关于刻晴…","desc":"刻晴姐姐为人细心，做事周全。逢年过节总会来问候师父，这就是所谓的「尊师重道」吧？还是说「知文达礼」比较合适？…总之，我也要向刻晴姐姐学习！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_keqing_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/0x58uh5hjql2iinjl1uc9u5tmves1xh.mp3"},{"title":"关于云堇…","desc":"云堇姐姐呀，她舞枪舞得可好啦，她表演的璃月戏也非常受欢迎，师父偶尔也会带我去看哦。只要有云堇姐姐登台，场面必是座无虚席，门不停宾…但、但…她唱的是什么意思呀？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_yunjin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3e/1p20xyfwgaruffcq1n79c9e57e90tvr.mp3"},{"title":"关于北斗…","desc":"北斗姐姐的船，好气派~要不是我和甘雨姐姐约好了不往船上跑，我连要在哪里搭个小小的床铺都想好了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_beidou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/svd5vt4jc9b38a57t8r41kj3mug5ia5.mp3"},{"title":"关于申鹤…","desc":"申鹤姐姐远离世俗多年，这次好不容易回到了璃月港，难免有很多不适应的地方。我也想帮着甘雨姐姐一起照顾她…可我要怎么开口，才不会让她觉得不自在呢？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_shenhe_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/rk8seb7r98sh21sqbtjygkd1z4jii2e.mp3"},{"title":"关于烟绯…","desc":"烟绯姐姐有一本厚厚的法典，就连休假来探望师父的时候，都随身带着呢，真厉害呀~能一直拿着这么重的东西，还要读这么难懂的东西…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_yanfei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/sjtwrsojpw70wgpsng3792slp3nsxp1.mp3"},{"title":"关于闲云…","desc":"那天我去找师父的时候，见到师父在和一位很有气质的姐姐聊天。她自称「闲云」，还想逗逗我呢，但我一眼就看出来她是留云阿姨啦！毕竟，看师父那高兴的样子，没有半点生分，分明是见到了一位老友嘛！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_teammate_xianyun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/evrbql0ii9my0pin14351fqsmab8151.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解瑶瑶·其一","desc":"瑶瑶的出身吗？我父母隐居于山郊，唔，按道理来说，我应该算是轻策庄人吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ef/m0yqd0ykhyohp3w3g4yh5521pbspic5.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解瑶瑶·其二","desc":"我家靠种植珍贵药草为生，家父家母忙碌的时候经常会忘记做家务，甚至连吃饭都会忘记…哎，这样怎么行呀！我得照顾好他们。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/3c8rdmjqbqyf0stmj497q89jrwj1o3b.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解瑶瑶·其三","desc":"我从小在山间长大，花草树木，还有小动物们都是我的朋友哦！对了，你想和小团雀聊聊天吗？我可以带你去，也可以帮你传话。来吧，很有趣的~我们先去准备点米粒给它们当做礼物！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/8rrrl2ggpwjfp2ewfoziadaggvytnwc.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解瑶瑶·其四","desc":"璃月到处都是仙人，我遇到过好多位呢！留云阿姨，理水叔叔…我最喜欢的就是留云阿姨啦！她送了我好多好玩的仙家物什，还细致地教我用法，让瑶瑶受益匪浅呢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/9hg65cvkue7mmlzq0yg0a62p9fa9nu3.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解瑶瑶·其五","desc":"遇见师父之后，她说我有仙缘，收我做了弟子。其实我至今还不懂仙缘到底是什么呀？但能在大家身边热热闹闹的，听师父讲故事，和师姐一起偷懒…还有帮上璃月港大家的忙，我非常知足！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/ndev8l1nt82dvo62hiulz5w30tzud4g.mp3"},{"title":"瑶瑶的爱好…","desc":"常言道，良宵苦短，胜事难逢！如果有什么好玩的事情，一定要过去看看才行呀…说不定还能遇上瑶瑶能帮上忙的事，你说对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/qsmub0qai3cxe88thoqwlr3nmekttzl.mp3"},{"title":"瑶瑶的烦恼…","desc":"哎、哎呀，练枪真的有点枯燥…我就和月桂玩一小会儿，休息一会儿就接着再练…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ac/7r1ro79zln5k7x5p2dayo9174jtd95p.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"轻策农家菜、来来菜、水煮鱼…这些璃月地道的味道不仅好吃，还能让人感到热闹。嗯？你也喜欢吗？太好了，那下次来我家吃饭吧，我来露一手！别担心，我帮师姐打过下手，在烹饪上也算「师出名门」呢！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_pref_foodLike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/35/fxlvu3puvk3wx06c83sgxrspu2peh57.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"有次申鹤姐姐一顿清心吃多了，身体虚了好几天呢！瑶瑶要爱惜身体，不生吃清心。唔？你问我怎么知道的？是留云阿姨跟我说起的哦！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/dk59vxko1l0ogyrz1f6itq826oe5ohs.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"太好吃啦！这厨艺简直和师姐「难舍难分」？不对，好像是「不相上下」！嘿嘿，瑶瑶一时激动，「口不择言」了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/b3nby5t4m480j1baokz79neq592sycp.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"好吃！下次做饭记得喊上我哦，让我帮你打下手吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/jw4n95ffcif4y5fif7rwf3u9dglhn21.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"…哎，你平时吃的都是这些吗？要不然还是让我来给你做饭吧！吃得不好怎么能出门冒险呢，要是累到了自己、身体垮了怎么办呀…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/ags738jivazqdtmh51z5jn5xpi7v8s6.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"今日是你的生辰，按照习俗，这样的日子要来一碗长寿面，我找师姐学了一手，一整条面都没有断哦！还打了个很圆很圆的鸡蛋进去，嘿嘿。快跟我来吧，要趁热吃才好。新的一岁，愿你身体健健康康，生活圆圆满满。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/cri2u0k5kuogknwbxthhh8233orhk7d.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"咦？枪怎么变轻了？要是能再变短点就更好了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3a/4in4qk3gtxgdblr70mabdvw5xwetgu0.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"哇哇，我现在说不定都能拿起师姐的枪了！真想现在就把这个好消息告诉师父~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/9aoicvegfgd4omhh56tm8ldtyd2hfj8.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"平时听大家说的「勤以立身」，就是这种感觉吧？欸？这个「勤」…不是勤奋的意思吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/24x7e15sblr9rth76r5zv0ngnvqcv0v.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"原来被人挂念的感觉是这样的，嗯…我能有这样的成长与变化，都是你的功劳哦！所谓投之以桃，报之以李，你放心吧，我会护你安然无虞的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/oox55ncmnq8patnhosqlyihttysct63.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"月桂！该上咯。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/nrd76mc8ovulcberkv6or9lj95zx9q1.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"不要乱动哦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/8jny9l26r8cgh3vsu6durdzdqmogcmt.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"不怕不怕。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/lkwfjkk7bk8ue58cwgazcfeotsgr8rk.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"预备…跑！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/8lb9xkpvfbbd1m4xmr28iqysf8zym5f.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"痛痛飞。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/23/7ed9m4guvnnecsoxfgoqz0ifa4zn7cd.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"要冲喽，月桂！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/rvaukv8domhpzpcsml6mfrw09u4qvvb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"都收好，不要落下哦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/726ncaquk3q70a2n7v3rvdxfeyrklp3.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"都整理好啦，请拿好。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/dfyzttw4q50vthhzswo13ipys1el1uw.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"哇！这些够用好几天了吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/54/hv97kfl9geu18z9a1959hx0swoprcgm.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"不行不行…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/f5vr6sc3xps6zqig325wq0hov3z4uvz.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"我要撑下去…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/me6jdd9gwu163ee9uvvi63b2732dt9c.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"没事，我可以的…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/fdgaw4u7ss1ulc8f5fiw908ktqm592g.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"让瑶瑶保护你！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/r9fk9s5i7u7dw8v2ofvyrzor8d3ky0e.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"人命关天，不要勉强！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/be/eyxb28xpl86on3mhwox8uoc34cywi0h.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"没办法再照顾大家了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/buhc56nl8pg0vn3er1e9jt9oivft8w4.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"有辱…师门…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/lyct4w0sqkvu9t1rtpyr8fl9p7qy4iw.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"枪好重…头也好重…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/hthdz3vnqhztxfju33bafs2l4502iux.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"痛痛。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/h5170umz3sj2ope2m5foampxbbla24l.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"好痛好痛…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_yaoyao/vo_yaoyao_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/f4oxmh5snbtdz27ilyde3l3iri75tcq.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"我会照顾好大家的。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yaoyao_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/lsuyiyb3kb9k9zjp6lftts5dgreb8es.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"我来领路，跟我走吧！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yaoyao_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/8nkn0zmiy9wxagayle7evaij52d1d99.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"我在，不用担心。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_yaoyao_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/nztwpxsdufr9z2x2pcfu4kqu4xpf57o.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000077-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000077-full.webp","fullArtWidth":659,"fullArtHeight":765}